#: source/policy_deployment/index.rst:2
msgid "Sim2Real Deployment of Policies Trained in Isaac Lab"
msgstr "Isaac Lab 训练策略的仿真到现实部署"

#: source/policy_deployment/index.rst:4
msgid ""
"Welcome to the Policy Deployment Guide! This section provides examples of "
"training policies in Isaac Lab and deploying them to both simulation and "
"real robots."
msgstr "欢迎来到策略部署指南！本节提供了在 Isaac Lab 中训练策略并将其部署到仿真和真实机器人的示例。"

#: source/policy_deployment/index.rst:6
msgid ""
"Below, you'll find detailed examples of various policies for training and "
"deploying them, along with essential configuration details."
msgstr "下文提供不同策略的训练与部署示例，以及所需的配置细节。"
